  "travelNote": "S1/S2 cover visits to eligible foreign residents. Family of Chinese citizens or permanent residents generally needs Q-route review instead; this pack does not cover Q visas. Confirm duration and eligible relationship. ExpatOne does not submit applications or grant permission to enter, reside or work.",
